<article class="env-lemma" id="0EBE">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0EBE">Lemma <span data-tag="0EBE">30.17.8</span>.</a> Let $X$ be a quasi-affine scheme. If $H^ p(X, \mathcal{O}_ X) = 0$ for $p > 0$, then $X$ is affine. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Since $\mathcal{O}_ X$ is ample by Properties, Lemma <a href="/tag/01QE" data-tag="01QE">28.28.1</a> this follows from Lemma <a href="/tag/0EBD" data-tag="0EBD">30.17.7</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>